CLOSURE_CHECKS_CLASSIFIER_AUDIT: {
  "schema_version": 1,
  "migration_run_id": "ccd7b51c-6e50-4e6d-ad9b-1bfbae5c705c",
  "snapshot_timestamp": "2026-05-21T04:18:36Z",
  "ticket_id": "136b-6758-ba12-47fc",
  "items": [
    {
      "original_text": "SC1: Running /dso:onboarding on a fully set-up project (all four phase artifacts present and pass their freshness checks) writes no files and surfaces no dialog questions. Verified in-session: SHA256 of all four phase artifact files (workflow-config.yaml, project-understanding.md, the enforcement-scaffolding file set, CLAUDE.md) match pre-run and post-run; phase-invocation log shows all four phases with outcome=noop.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable system behavior where the onboarding command idempotently handles fully-configured projects without modification"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "SC2: Running /dso:onboarding after editing workflow-config.yaml re-renders only CLAUDE.md. SHA256 of project-understanding.md and each enforcement-scaffolding file unchanged; SHA256 of CLAUDE.md differs. Phase-invocation log shows generate-claude-md outcome=executed with invocation_reason=dependent_artifact_changed.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable system behavior where the onboarding process selectively re-renders only affected artifacts based on dependency tracking"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "SC3: Running /dso:onboarding after deleting project-understanding.md (precondition: workflow-config.yaml and CLAUDE.md present and fresh) runs only the dialogue and architect-foundation phases. Post-run: workflow-config.yaml and CLAUDE.md SHA256 unchanged; project-understanding.md and enforcement-scaffolding files written. Phase-invocation log shows exactly four entries: init outcome=noop, dialogue outcome=executed, architect-foundation outcome=executed, generate-claude-md outcome=noop.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "transitional",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a specific test scenario execution with expected outcomes, verifying a one-time migration/deletion behavior rather than ongoing system capability"
      },
      "user_decision": "accept",
      "post_migration_section": "CC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "SC4: The three previously-user-invocable skills (/dso:init, /dso:architect-foundation, /dso:generate-claude-md) no longer appear in `claude plugin list` output, and their directories under plugins/dso/skills/ are absent.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 5,
        "rationale": "describes a durable state where skills are permanently absent from both the plugin list output and filesystem, not a one-time completion event"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "SC5: Phase files in skills/onboarding/phases/<phase>.md are <=80 non-blank, non-comment lines each. Conditional dialogue and behavioral content for each conditional axis (stack, CI platform, design system, infrastructure type, plus any others identified during extraction) is decomposed into one or more skills/onboarding/prompts/<topic>.md files, loaded via Read only when the executing phase determines the topic applies.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes durable organizational properties of the codebase (file structure, line limits, conditional decomposition) that persist after implementation"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "SC6: Cross-references in CLAUDE.md, plugins/dso/docs/**/*.md, and other skills' SKILL.md files are updated. `grep -rn \"dso:init\\|dso:architect-foundation\\|dso:generate-claude-md\" plugins/ .claude/ CLAUDE.md` returns zero matches.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "transitional",
        "ranking": 5,
        "rationale": "describes a one-time task of updating cross-references and verifying their removal through a grep check, with completion indicated by zero matches"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "CC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "SC7: A freshness-check contract documented at plugins/dso/docs/onboarding-resume-contract.md containing a markdown table whose rows are the four phases and whose columns are output_artifact, freshness_predicate, dependent_inputs, re-run_trigger.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable documented artifact (contract specification) that persists as an ongoing reference after creation"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "SC8: The <SUB-AGENT-GUARD> is preserved on the new /dso:onboarding SKILL.md. Verified by dispatching /dso:onboarding via the Agent tool with subagent_type: \"general-purpose\" and asserting the returned text contains the literal string \"ERROR: /dso:onboarding requires main session; invoke directly.\".",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "transitional",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a one-time verification task completed during migration, not an ongoing system property"
      },
      "user_decision": "reject",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    },
    {
      "original_text": "SC9: A behavioral test at tests/scripts/test-onboarding-resume.sh exercises each freshness predicate against a fixture project across four cases: (a) all artifacts fresh -> all phases no-op; (b) workflow-config.yaml modified -> only generate-claude-md executes; (c) project-understanding.md deleted -> dialogue and architect-foundation execute; (d) CLAUDE.md deleted -> only generate-claude-md executes. Test asserts on the phase-invocation log artifact and passes in CI.",
      "original_section": "SC",
      "classification": {
        "label": "end-state",
        "ranking": 4,
        "rationale": "describes a durable testing capability that validates freshness predicates and will remain in the system after implementation"
      },
      "user_decision": "auto",
      "post_migration_section": "SC"
    }
  ]
}
